sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant OS
    participant App as Application
    participant Act as First Activity
    participant Cache as Room/cache (Ch 12)
    participant Net as Backend

    User->>OS: tap icon
    OS->>App: fork + onCreate (minimal)
    App->>App: essential init only (DI, crash)
    App->>Act: start first Activity
    Act->>Act: setContent (skeleton)
    Act-->>User: first frame (TTID) fast
    Act->>Cache: load cached feed
    Cache-->>Act: cached data
    Act-->>User: content shown
    Act->>Act: reportFullyDrawn (TTFMC)
    Act->>Net: fetch fresh (background)
    Net-->>Act: fresh -> update UI
